# Where the frontend finds the backend. Usually leave it unset:
#   `npm run dev`   -> http://localhost:8000 (uvicorn in the two-process dev loop)
#   `npm run build` -> same-origin (FastAPI serves the built frontend itself, IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md Part 5.6)
#
# To override for dev only, put it in .env.development.local (git-ignored) - NOT .env.local,
# which Vite also loads for `npm run build` and would point the demo build at the wrong place.
# Accepted: an absolute http(s) URL, a path such as /api (same-origin), or empty (same-origin).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
